| `ticket:create` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |
| `ticket:update` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| `ticket:delete` | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ |
| `ticket:assign` | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ |
| `ticket:comment` | ✅ | ✅ | ✅ |

